DESCRIPTION:Join us to celebrate November’s 𝐅𝐢𝐫𝐬𝐭 𝐅
 𝐫𝐢𝐝𝐚𝐲 𝐇𝐚𝐩𝐩𝐲 𝐇𝐨𝐮𝐫 tomorrow!\n6 No
 vember\, from 4-5:30pm\nFree admission to the galleries\, complimentary ba
 r service and nibbles.\nEach guest will receive two non-transferrable drin
 k tickets at the door. A non-alcoholic option will also be available.\nBes
 t of all\, EXPERIENCE THE ART! The Museum hosts First Friday happy hour in
  the spirit of our founder Matthias H. Arnot who opened the doors to his h
 ome regularly and welcomed the public to view his art collection. Not only
  can you enjoy Mr. Arnot’s 1890’s Picture Gallery at happy hour\, but 
 the Museum always has new art to see in the contemporary West Wing.\n𝑮
 𝒖𝒆𝒔𝒕𝒔 𝒂𝒓𝒆 𝒘𝒆𝒍𝒄𝒐𝒎𝒆 𝒕𝒐 
 𝒘𝒂𝒏𝒅𝒆𝒓 𝒕𝒉𝒆 𝒈𝒂𝒍𝒍𝒆𝒓𝒊𝒆𝒔
