BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:“A Community in Concert” celebrating America's 250th Anniversa
 ry at Corning Museum of Glass
DTSTART:20261108T200000Z
DTEND:20261109T045959Z
DTSTAMP:20261107T153814Z
UID:393d6876a91ccaa259cc8dc1e68bb5b99f0305bf@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Music,Community,History & Heritage
DESCRIPTION:The Corning Area Community Concert Band invites the public to 
 A Community in Concert\, a special Fall Scholarship Concert celebrating Am
 erican music and American composers in honor of our nation's 250th anniver
 sary.\nThe free concert will take place Sunday\, November 8\, 2026\, at 3:
 00 PM\, in the Corning Museum of Glass Auditorium\, One Museum Way\, Corni
 ng\, NY.\nUnder the direction of Tina Sochia\, the afternoon will bring to
 gether five regional ensembles: the Corning Area Community Concert Band\, 
 Southern Tier All-Star Jazz Band\, Cantata Singers\, Corning Brassworks\, 
 and Monday Night Clarinets.\nThe program will feature a diverse selection 
 of American musical favorites\, celebrating our nation's rich musical heri
 tage and the extraordinary talent within our Southern Tier community.\nAdm
 ission is free. Voluntary donations are welcome to support the band's annu
 al $1\,000 scholarship for graduating high school musicians from Steuben\,
  Schuyler\, and Chemung counties.\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calenda
 r.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78507363/20261108150000
GEO:42.1498;77.0542
LOCATION:Corning Museum of Glass\, One Museum Way\, Corning\, NY\, 14830
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78507363/20261108150000
END:VEVENT
