CATEGORIES:Art,Connection
DESCRIPTION:Join The ARTS Council of the Southern Finger Lakes for a panel
  discussion featuring local artists\, nonprofit leaders\, and experienced 
 grant writers: Bridget Bossart van Otterloo\, Wynn Yarrow\, and Kelly Pove
 ro.\nTogether we will cover topics such as:\n· What do you wish you had k
 nown when you started out writing grants?\n· What are ways to make grant 
 writing easier?\n· How do you set artist fees?\n· What really happens du
 ring a grant review?\nFree and open to the public! Bring your questions.\n
 _\nThe ARTS Council of the Southern Finger Lakes’ Statewide Community Re
 grant (SCR) program is made possible by the New York State Council on the 
 Arts with the support of the Office of the Governor and the New York State
  Legislature.\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/e
