CATEGORIES:Community,Music,LGBTQ+,Art
DESCRIPTION:Event by Card Carrying Books & Gifts\n15 East Market Street\nC
 orning\, NY\nDuration: 3 hr\nPublic\nThree years ago on November 15\, I bo
 ught the best little bookstore in Corning\, NY!\nCome celebrate my three y
 ear ownership anniversary at Card Carrying Books & Gifts on Sunday\, Novem
 ber 15\, from 12–3! We’ll have cake\, snacks\, and the music will be b
 umping! I’d love to spend the afternoon with the people who make this pl
 ace what it is.\nWe’re putting together a community memory board\, so co
 me add a favorite memory from the store and tell me what you’d love to d
 o here next. Bring a friend you’ve been meaning to introduce to the stor
 e!\nIf Small Business Saturday on November 28 doesn’t work for your sche
 dule\, this is another chance to get some holiday shopping done while cele
 brating with us. Every purchase helps keep this bookstore going and makes 
 room for more of what we do together.\nCommunity is a verb\, and I’m so 
 grateful for the ways y’all keep showing up. Come have some cake and cel
 ebrate your favorite indie bookstore!!\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://ca
 lendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78508329/20261115120000
