 aregivers" takes place Wednesday/November 18\, 2026\, 1:30-3:00pm. Registe
 r at 607-737-5520/Chemung County Department of Aging and Long Term Care.\n
 People not only will play "Wreath Bingo" for the chance to take home a har
 dy plant\, but also have the opportunity to paint holiday ornaments with A
 rtist Jennifer Sekella to enhance what plants they might already have at h
 ome! LECC is a wellness open house offering access to essential\, best-car
 e resources in a supportive environment for all participants\, who can eng
 age with professionals from the host organizations onsite to learn and ask
