  available to rent for $5 each\nVendors are also welcome to bring their ow
 n tables!\nVendor registration & payment:\nContact Melinda Hernandez\nPaym
 ent can be made through Venmo or cash.\nALL PROCEEDS HELP SUPPORT OUR PAGE
 ANT PROGRAM & COMMUNITY INITIATIVES!\nThe Crystal City Pageant is more tha
 n just a beauty contest. Our crowned queens will spend their year focused 
 on purpose\, impact & service\, giving back to our community through month
 ly volunteering\, parades\, events and meaningful causes.\nSome of the cau
 ses we plan to support include:\nHelping Veterans\nChristmas Assistance & 
 Giving Programs\nBack-to-School Drives\nFood Bank Support\nAnimal Shelter 
 Donations\nAnd so many more!\nEvery vendor\, shopper and supporter who par
 ticipates in our Craft Fair is helping us provide opportunities for our qu
 eens while allowing them to make a difference right here in our community.
